Package: curveRfreq
Title: Frequentist Immunoassay Standard Curve Fitting
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Seamus O.", "Stein",
           email = "seamusstein@gmail.com",
           role = "aut"),
    person("Michael Scot", "Zens",
           email = "michael.s.zens@dartmouth.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Anne G.", "Hoen",
           email = "anne.g.hoen@dartmouth.edu",
           role = "aut")
  )
Description: Frequentist standard curve fitting for immunoassay data
    (bead array and ELISA). Fits an ensemble of five nonlinear models
    (4PL, 5PL, loglogistic, Richards, Gompertz) via Levenberg-Marquardt
    nonlinear least squares, selects the best model by AIC, and propagates
    measurement uncertainty via the delta method. Depends on curveRcore
    for model math, ensuring parameterisation parity with curveRbayes.
URL: https://github.com/immunoplex/curveRfreq
BugReports: https://github.com/immunoplex/curveRfreq/issues
